        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Vincenzo Bellini, Maria Callas, John Ardoin\n- Topics: Opera, musical style, biography\n\nFacts:\n- Vincenzo Bellini was an Italian composer.\n- Vincenzo Bellini’s full name was Vincenzo Salvatore Carmelo Francesco Bellini.\n- Vincenzo Bellini was known for his long-flowing melodic lines.\n- Maria Callas included Vincenzo Bellini’s works in her repertoire.\n- John Ardoin wrote four books about Maria Callas.",
